  "notes": "{攻|せ}める means to attack or take offensive action, used in military, sports, and figurative contexts.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{敵|てき}→敵：03546_teki⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{攻|せ}める: to attack the enemy\n- ⟦{城|しろ}→城：03255_shiro⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{攻|せ}める: to attack a castle\n- ⟦{弱点|じゃくてん}→弱点：12497_jakuten⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{攻|せ}める: to target a weakness\n\nDON'T CONFUSE (both せめる):\n- {攻|せ}める: to attack (military/sports)\n- ⟦{責|せ}める→責める：02284_semeru⟧: to blame, criticize\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n⟦{守|まも}る→守る：01986_mamoru⟧: to defend, protect\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{攻撃|こうげき}→攻撃：02748_kougeki⟧: attack (noun)\n- {攻|せ}め: offense, attack",
